{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19107","headline":"宣上人远寄和礼部王侍郎放榜後诗因而继和 · 刘禹锡","name":"宣上人远寄和礼部王侍郎放榜後诗因而继和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"礼闱新榜动长安，九陌人人走马看。\n一日声名遍天下，满城桃李属春官。\n自吟白雪诠词赋，指示青云借羽翰。\n借问至公谁印可，支郎天眼定中观。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}